      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "Shutt® probes are designed specifically for arthroscopic surgery. Unique handles",
        "give a firm grip and aid in instrument control. Shafts are hardened to resist breakage",
        "and tapered for better visualization. All straight probes have etched graduations",
        "in 5mm increments. All probes are limited-reuse and may be disinfected, steam",
        "autoclaved or ethylene oxide sterilized."
      ],
